(
    title: "Final Approach",
    description: Some("As an air-traffic controller at a busy international airport, the player steers incoming aircraft around a radar screen, keeping them spaced apart, then switches to a ground-approach view to line each plane up on the glide slope and localizer for a safe touchdown. Let two aircraft drift too close and it counts as a near-miss; any plane that starts flashing has an emergency and must be given priority and landed at once."),
